9787-47b6-a148-4aaa83d177de.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1686604/4d13c99a-9787-47b6-a148-4aaa83d177de.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Welcome at HyggeStay!\n\nThis 2-room flat, freshly furnished in 2025, offers you a stylish home for 1-2 people. With its modern furnishings and excellent facilities, it is perfect for a short or long-term stay in Lübeck.\n\nWhat awaits you:\n→ Freshly furnished with great attention to detail\n→ A comfortable double bed (160x200cm)\n→ Fully equipped workplace in the bedroom (desk 120x70cm with installed 27’ monitor)\n→ Additional sleeping option with a cosy sofa bed\n→ NESPRESSO coffee machine for the perfect start to the day\n→ Fully equipped kitchen\n→ Practical washer-dryer (AEG test winner)\n→ 50’ smart TV with Netflix for relaxing evenings\n→ Stylish floorboards for a warm living atmosphere\n→ Parking directly on the public street in front of the house\n→ within walking distance: supermarket (150m) restaurants, and the old town (1.2km). Train station: 1.7km\n→ fast WLAN (1,000 MBit) for work or entertainment\n\nMake yourself at home and enjoy your stay - we look forward to seeing you!\n\nThe flat is located on the 3rd floor of a typical Lübeck Gründerzeit building. It has a beautiful, quiet bedroom facing the inner courtyard, a bathroom and a spacious and cosy living and dining room.\n\nTop location in Lübeck\nThe flat is located in the immediate vicinity of Lübeck's old town (1.2 km away). Shopping facilities, restaurants and cafés are within walking distance (supermarket: 150 m, train station: 1.7 km). Thanks to the good transport connections, you can reach the Baltic Sea in just 20 minutes by car and Hamburg in around 45 minutes.\n\nStart your day with a good coffee, explore Lübeck's charming old town or enjoy a trip to the surrounding area. This flat offers you a stylish and cosy temporary home.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you!\n\n✅ Services\n\nLandlord confirmation for residence registration (Wohnungsgeberbestätigun(hidden)box and doorbell name label change possible\n\n✅ Furnishings & Equipment\nGeneral\n\nWashing machine (in the building)\nDryer (in the building)\nCoffee machine\nTV\nDesk or workspace\nWiFi\nIntercom system\n\nKitchen\n\nDishwasher\nKettle\nStove\nRefrigerator\nOven\nMicrowave\nToaster\nCutlery\nFreezer\n\nBedroom\n\nBed linen\nPillows\nBlankets\nBedside lamp\nWardrobe or chest of drawers\n\nBathroom\n\nShower\nHairdryer\nTowels\n\nOther\n\nIron\nIroning board\nVacuum cleaner\nBroom\nSmoke detector","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"44"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":119000,"deposit":120000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1190.00","deposit":"1200.00","agency